\label{def:chebyshev_polynomial}
The $n$-th Chebyshev polynomial of the first kind is defined as
\[
	T_n(x) = \begin{cases}
		\cos(n\arccos x) &\text{if } \abs{x}\leq 1, \\
		\cosh(n\cosh^{-1}x) &\text{if }x>1, \\
		(-1)^n\cosh(n\cosh^{-1}(-x)) &\text{if }x<-1. \\
	\end{cases}
\]
